# KMP Agent Rules

Always invoke `kmp-agentic-starter` first before working in this project.

## Hard Rules

- Minimal focused edits only.
- Prefer maintained KMP packages before custom reusable code.
- Keep shared business logic in `shared`.
- Keep Android Compose UI in `androidApp`.
- Keep iOS SwiftUI UI in `iosApp`.
- Keep shared APIs Swift-friendly when consumed by iOS.
- Never commit secrets or generated credentials.
- Verify with Gradle/Xcode commands relevant to touched code.
